================================================================================
CHALLENGE: THE LOG WRITER
================================================================================
1. Create a method 'logTransaction(String msg)'.
2. Inside, use a 'FileWriter' to write the message to a file named "log.txt".
3. REQUIREMENT: Use "Try-with-Resources" syntax:
   'try (FileWriter fw = new FileWriter("log.txt", true)) { ... }'
4. Observation: Notice that you don't need a 'finally' block to close the file!
   Java closes it automatically even if an exception occurs.
================================================================================